{
  "declaredLength": 8216,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Mira este Corvisquire.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069007200610020006500730074006500200043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Traía consigo un pañuelo hecho polvo que se\nnotaba que era muy importante para él.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me da la impresión de que está buscando\nal propietario...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650020006400610020006C006100200069006D0070007200650073006900F3006E0020006400650020007100750065002000650073007400E1002000620075007300630061006E0064006F000A0061006C002000700072006F0070006900650074006100720069006F002E002E002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sin embargo, solo contamos con una pista:\nel nombre bordado en el pañuelo, <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Corsino<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cooorvi!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006F006F00720076006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Has visto? Ha reaccionado al oír el nombre.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00480061007300200076006900730074006F003F0020004800610020007200650061006300630069006F006E00610064006F00200061006C0020006F00ED007200200065006C0020006E006F006D006200720065002E00100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿No conocerás a alguien que pueda saber algo\nmás sobre pañuelos o ropa en general?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Acris podría saber algo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006300720069007300200070006F0064007200ED006100200073006100620065007200200061006C0067006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le preguntaré a Bárbara",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065002000700072006500670075006E00740061007200E9002000610020004200E1007200620061007200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres saber algo más acerca de un pañuelo?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCreo que sería mejor idea que preguntaras a\nAcris. Siento no serte de más ayuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Hola?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Qué dices acerca de un pañuelo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0048006F006C0061003F00100001BE01000A00BF0051007500E9002000640069006300650073002000610063006500720063006100200064006500200075006E00200070006100F100750065006C006F003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver, sé bastante de telas, pero no como para\nsaber de quién es solo con mirarlo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ah, se me ha ocurrido una idea! ¿Qué tal si\npruebas a preguntarle a Sakura?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Podrás encontrarla en la Boutique Très Chic.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEs una diseñadora experta donde las haya,\npero te advierto de que es muy \"suya\".<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi alguien puede darte más información con tan\nsolo ese pañuelo, es ella.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 210
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ánimo. Seguro que darás con la persona a la que\npertenece, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C1006E0069006D006F002E002000530065006700750072006F0020007100750065002000640061007200E1007300200063006F006E0020006C006100200070006500720073006F006E0061002000610020006C00610020007100750065000A00700065007200740065006E006500630065002C00200010000201000000002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Diría que has dado con una pista, ¿me equivoco?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPor favor, ayuda a este Corvisquire a dar con\nla persona a la que pertenece el pañuelo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, ayuda a este Corvisquire a dar con\nla persona a la que pertenece el pañuelo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Corvi!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F00720076006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Soy Sakura, la famosa diseñadora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F0079002000530061006B007500720061002C0020006C0061002000660061006D006F007300610020006400690073006500F100610064006F00720061002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Vienes a retarme a otro elegante combate\ncon megaevoluciones glamurosas?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, mira este pañuelo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006D0069007200610020006500730074006500200070006100F100750065006C006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías mirar este pañuelo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0050006F0064007200ED006100730020006D00690072006100720020006500730074006500200070006100F100750065006C006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Solo quiero que mires este pañuelo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006C006F002000710075006900650072006F00200071007500650020006D00690072006500730020006500730074006500200070006100F100750065006C006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que buscas mi consejo como diseñadora\nexperta, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED002000710075006500200062007500730063006100730020006D006900200063006F006E00730065006A006F00200063006F006D006F0020006400690073006500F100610064006F00720061000A0065007800700065007200740061002C002000BF007600650072006400610064003F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Este pañuelo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006500200070006100F100750065006C006F002E002E002E001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está bastante sucio, pero creo que lo reconozco.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPor su diseño y tela, diría que es el pañuelo que\nse entrega a los nuevos alumnos de cierto centro<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde Ciudad Puntera, en Galar.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY, para más señas, es de hace unos tres años.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 236
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A todo esto, ¿cómo ha ido a parar este pañuelo\na tus manos?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100200074006F0064006F0020006500730074006F002C002000BF006300F3006D006F002000680061002000690064006F002000610020007000610072006100720020006500730074006500200070006100F100750065006C006F000A006100200074007500730020006D0061006E006F0073003F001000020114003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo llevaba este Corvisquire",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F0020006C006C006500760061006200610020006500730074006500200043006F0072007600690073007100750069007200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy buscando a su propietario",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730074006F0079002000620075007300630061006E0064006F00200061002000730075002000700072006F0070006900650074006100720069006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que estás buscando a la persona cuyo\nnombre está bordado en el pañuelo...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Qué investigación tan estilosa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué tal si te pasas por la Escuela Perseida?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi esa persona se encuentra en Ciudad Luminalia,\npuede que esté estudiando allí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si esa persona se encuentra en Ciudad Luminalia,\npuede que estudie en la Escuela Perseida.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Corviiis!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F00720076006900690069007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero bueno, ¿de dónde ha salido este\nCorvisquire?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006200750065006E006F002C002000BF006400650020006400F3006E00640065002000680061002000730061006C00690064006F00200065007300740065000A0043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera...  ¡No me digas que tú eres aquel\nRookidee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730070006500720061002E002E002E0020002000A1004E006F0020006D006500200064006900670061007300200071007500650020007400FA0020006500720065007300200061007100750065006C000A0052006F006F006B0069006400650065002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cooor!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006F006F007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Qué me dices?! Pero si nos conocimos en Galar.\n¿Has cruzado el mar solo para verme?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cooor!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006F006F007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y eso que estabas herido y eras un pipiolo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000650073006F002000710075006500200065007300740061006200610073002000680065007200690064006F002000790020006500720061007300200075006E00200070006900700069006F006C006F002E002E002E00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿En serio has venido a buscarme a Ciudad\nLuminalia después de que me mudara?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eres magnífico!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450072006500730020006D00610067006E00ED006600690063006F002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Corviiis!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F00720076006900690069007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa, ¡gracias por ayudar a Corvisquire\na buscarme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E007400720065006E00610064006F007200100003110000FF01000061002C002000A1006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200061007900750064006100720020006100200043006F007200760069007300710075006900720065000A00610020006200750073006300610072006D0065002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Crees que querrá ser mi compañero?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00430072006500650073002000710075006500200071007500650072007200E100200073006500720020006D006900200063006F006D0070006100F100650072006F003F00100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Claro que sí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006C00610072006F00200071007500650020007300ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seguro que le encantaría",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530065006700750072006F00200071007500650020006C006500200065006E00630061006E00740061007200ED00610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te puedo pedir otro favorcillo más?\n¡Combate contra nosotros, porfa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006500200070007500650064006F0020007000650064006900720020006F00740072006F0020006600610076006F007200630069006C006C006F0020006D00E10073003F000A00A10043006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E0074007200610020006E006F0073006F00740072006F0073002C00200070006F007200660061002100100002011401CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avísame cuando estés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6492,
